@startuml state-exception
!include style.puml
title Lifecycle of an exception

[*] --> Created : exception object allocated
Created --> Propagating : raise
Propagating --> Propagating : frame cleanup runs,\nTracebackEntry added,\nreturned to caller
Propagating --> Handled : matching except clause
Propagating --> Uncaught : main module returns it
Propagating --> AtExportBoundary : reaches a function exported to C
Handled --> Propagating : raise inside the handler
Handled --> Released : handler ends
Uncaught --> Reported : printed, last line as in CPython
Reported --> [*] : exit status 1
AtExportBoundary --> [*] : printed, program aborts
Released --> [*]
@enduml
